text = "[center][pulse freq=3.0 color=#ffffff64 ease=-100.0][color=#ff1c18]You[/color][/pulse] fled  ([color=#ff8864][shake rate=7.0 level=5 connected=0]cowardly[/shake][/color])!

[shake rate=7.0 level=5 connected=0][color=#ff8864]How  unexpected...[/color][/shake]
Seems like the thought  of  actually facing  what  was in front  of you  was  a bit too  much  to  handle.
Was it the challenge  or  ([color=#ff8864][shake rate=7.0 level=5 connected=0]maybe[/shake][/color]) the [shake rate=7.0 level=5 connected=0][color=#ff1c18]fear[/color][/shake]?

Either way, you sure  know  how  to  leave an impression...

[shake rate=7.0 level=5 connected=0][color=#ff8864]Just [color=#ff1c18]not the  one[/color] you were  aiming  for[/color][/shake]![/center]"
metadata/_edit_lock_ = true

