bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[center][pulse freq=3.0 color=#ffffff64 ease=-100.0][color=#ff1c18]You[/color][/pulse] tried  something  ([color=#ff8864]how  ambitious[/color])!

[shake rate=7.0 level=5 connected=0][color=#ff8864]That  didn’t go  as  [color=#ff1c18]planned[/color]...[/color][/shake]
It  seems  like you had  a grand idea, but the execution?
Let’s just say it wasn’t exactly impressive.
[shake rate=7.0 level=5 connected=0][color=#ff8864]Maybe next time, try thinking it through[/color][/shake].

You sure know how to make  an entrance...
[shake rate=7.0 level=5 connected=0][color=#ff8864]Just  not  the best  one![/color][/shake][/center]"
