text = "[center][pulse freq=3.0 color=#ffffff64 ease=-100.0][color=#ff1c18]Oh look[/color][/pulse],  an attack!

[shake rate=7.0 level=5 connected=0][color=#ff8864]Surprised?[/color][/shake] Didn’t think it’d be that easy, did you?

The  assault  comes  fast  (probably  more than you can  handle).
[shake rate=7.0 level=5 connected=0][color=#ff8864]Good luck with that[/color][/shake]. You’ll need it.

Maybe you'd  better  prepare  to  [shake rate=7.0 level=5 connected=0][color=#ff8864]meet your  [color=#ff1c18]fate[/color][/color][/shake]?[/center]"
